WEBVTT

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:10.750
But why would Nanami-senpai...

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:13.160
like me?

00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:28.330
"And so, I believe that Nanami-senpai
would serve as a role model

00:00:28.330 --> 00:00:32.410
Campaign Speech Assembly

00:00:28.330 --> 00:00:32.000
for the entire student body,
making this school a much better place."

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:35.700
"This concludes my campaign speech."

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:39.500
That was perfect!

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:43.200
At this rate, once the election's over,
you're bound to be on the student council too.

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:44.910
Huh? No, I'm not joining that.

00:00:44.910 --> 00:00:48.290
I bet you'd have fun if you did, though.

00:00:48.620 --> 00:00:52.000
Like back in middle school, when they were
always after you to join the softball club...

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:53.500
Till, finally, you ended up being a regular.

00:00:54.830 --> 00:00:57.200
You're the type that, once you start something,
you really get into it.

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:00.750
Even with the way you're helping out now,
you're totally giving it your all!

00:01:00.750 --> 00:01:02.910
Look, I'm not joining up!

00:02:37.540 --> 00:02:39.580
What'll you be doing during our time off?

00:02:39.910 --> 00:02:42.040
Nothing much, really.

00:02:42.040 --> 00:02:45.250
After all, I have to memorize that campaign speech...

00:02:45.580 --> 00:02:47.370
Won't be long now, huh?

00:02:48.160 --> 00:02:52.160
Still, it feels good to know that the end's in sight.

00:02:52.910 --> 00:02:56.540
But if I'm elected, we'll have those
student council activities awaiting us.

00:02:56.540 --> 00:02:59.620
I never actually said I'd planned on joining up...

00:02:59.620 --> 00:03:01.950
Huh?! Come on, you have to!

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:05.200
Why are we suddenly talking about this now?

00:03:08.950 --> 00:03:09.950
Want some?

00:03:10.410 --> 00:03:11.700
Thanks very much.

00:03:15.330 --> 00:03:16.330
Here you go.

00:03:22.450 --> 00:03:23.450
Okay, well...

00:03:23.950 --> 00:03:25.250
See you later.

00:03:28.410 --> 00:03:29.330
Wait.

00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:33.040
I'm headed that way today.

00:03:33.370 --> 00:03:34.910
You're not going to the station?

00:03:35.290 --> 00:03:37.370
I want to stop by the bookstore.

00:03:37.700 --> 00:03:38.830
"Bookstore"?

00:03:39.370 --> 00:03:41.950
There's one just up the road, right?

00:03:42.330 --> 00:03:45.290
I'm going on a trip during our time off,
so I'd like something to read.

00:03:49.580 --> 00:03:52.450
How big is your family, Senpai?

00:03:52.450 --> 00:03:56.290
It's just the three of us, my parents and me.
How about you, Koito-san?

00:03:56.290 --> 00:03:59.330
My older sister, my parents, and my grandmother.

00:03:59.330 --> 00:04:01.910
Oh! Things must get pretty lively, huh?

00:04:01.910 --> 00:04:04.000
Well, it's got its good points and bad points.

00:04:04.750 --> 00:04:06.250
Fujishiro Bookstore

00:04:04.870 --> 00:04:06.250
This is the place.

00:04:06.700 --> 00:04:07.870
I knew it...

00:04:12.370 --> 00:04:13.830
Welcome!

00:04:14.410 --> 00:04:16.750
Oh, Yuu-chan! You're back.

00:04:16.750 --> 00:04:17.750
Yup, sure am.

00:04:17.750 --> 00:04:18.660
Huh?

00:04:20.250 --> 00:04:22.410
This is my family's store.

00:04:22.410 --> 00:04:25.580
What?! Y-you should've told me before!

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:27.830
Camellia
Hierarchy

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:27.500
You surprised?

00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:29.830
But, this is the Fujishiro Bookstore...

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:31.700
That's because it's my grandma's.

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:34.700
Well, now I'm super nervous!

00:04:34.700 --> 00:04:37.910
You're my senpai, so there's no need to be nervous.

00:04:38.290 --> 00:04:42.950
It's kind of like, "I'm so sorry for having
taken advantage of your daughter!"

00:04:43.830 --> 00:04:45.870
It's not like I've been taken advantage of...

00:04:46.620 --> 00:04:50.000
Welcome back! Oh. You brought a friend?

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:52.200
This is Nanami-senpai from the student council.

00:04:52.580 --> 00:04:55.250
I've mentioned her, right? I'm helping with her election.

00:04:55.250 --> 00:04:58.160
Oh! And she's just as pretty as I've heard!

00:04:59.120 --> 00:05:02.250
Thank you! For looking out for our girl, that is.

00:05:02.620 --> 00:05:07.540
Not at all. She's done so much for me already,
and has been a big help.

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:11.160
My, you're too kind. She hasn't been
getting in the way at all?

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:14.580
That person before was so well-mannered!

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:17.700
It's all an act if you ask me...

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:20.040
That's a rude thing to say about your senpai!

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:22.200
Huh? Wait, who is this?

00:05:22.200 --> 00:05:24.000
Just butt out, Rei-chan.

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:27.000
Oh, my. Did you bring a boyfriend home?

00:05:27.830 --> 00:05:29.750
Your big sis is all ears...

00:05:29.750 --> 00:05:33.080
We're talking about her senpai. And she's a girl.

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:35.750
Huh? So, your girlfriend?

00:05:36.620 --> 00:05:38.160
Of course not.

00:05:38.370 --> 00:05:42.330
Your old man wouldn't be able to take
a shock like that, you know.

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:55.040
Got any free time during vacay?
Natsuki and Koyomi are coming,

00:05:51.710 --> 00:05:55.040
so u wanna hang out?

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:53.910
It's from Akari...

00:05:58.700 --> 00:06:00.250
Hey, what's up?!

00:06:00.580 --> 00:06:02.870
Natsuki! It's been forever.

00:06:03.330 --> 00:06:06.370
We've barely met since goin'
to different high schools, huh?

00:06:06.500 --> 00:06:09.580
Yeah, well, you never respond to my texts!

00:06:09.750 --> 00:06:13.370
What club did you end up joining?
Higashi High doesn't have softball, right?

00:06:13.370 --> 00:06:17.330
She's not in a club, but she is helping out
with the student council.

00:06:17.330 --> 00:06:19.700
The student council? That's a shock.

00:06:19.950 --> 00:06:21.000
As for me, I'm-

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:24.040
Chasing your senpai and
playing basketball, right? I know that.

00:06:24.500 --> 00:06:25.700
Hey, let me talk!

00:06:28.080 --> 00:06:29.620
It's too cute, so, no.

00:06:29.620 --> 00:06:31.330
You haven't changed at all, huh?

00:06:32.790 --> 00:06:33.790
How's this?

00:06:33.790 --> 00:06:34.950
Almost there...

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:37.410
Oh, no! I messed up!

00:06:37.410 --> 00:06:38.620
Score!

00:06:42.120 --> 00:06:43.660
Take them back - All the things that you love

00:06:43.160 --> 00:06:45.330
Is this the one you wanted to see, Natsuki?

00:06:43.660 --> 00:06:45.080
Right Now, It's You I Love

00:06:45.330 --> 00:06:45.950
Yup.

00:06:46.540 --> 00:06:48.200
A romance, huh?

00:06:49.790 --> 00:06:50.750
Do you mind?

00:06:50.750 --> 00:06:51.620
Oh...

00:06:52.750 --> 00:06:56.200
Yeah, okay!

00:06:56.580 --> 00:06:57.830
You want popcorn?

00:06:58.080 --> 00:06:59.580
Whatever.

00:07:08.790 --> 00:07:10.750
That was a good movie, huh?

00:07:10.750 --> 00:07:14.080
I'm reading the book, but the movie is good too.

00:07:14.290 --> 00:07:18.040
They both liked each other,
so it was like, "Just say it already!"

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:20.950
If they did that, there'd be no movie!

00:07:20.950 --> 00:07:23.790
It's just so frustrating, watching the two of them...

00:07:24.290 --> 00:07:29.120
You know what I mean, right?
Just tell your senpai how you feel already!

00:07:29.410 --> 00:07:32.040
Ah. Yeah...

00:07:34.580 --> 00:07:37.700
The truth is, I already got turned down.

00:07:42.160 --> 00:07:45.410
Oh. Um... Sorry.

00:07:45.410 --> 00:07:47.700
No, it's fine. Don't worry about it.

00:07:48.040 --> 00:07:50.660
Still, watching a love story right now is kinda-

00:07:50.660 --> 00:07:54.750
Really, it's fine! Don't make
this more awkward for me, okay?

00:07:55.290 --> 00:07:56.200
But...

00:07:56.950 --> 00:07:58.950
I'm actually okay with it.

00:07:59.370 --> 00:08:02.700
I'd be more depressed
if there was another girl in the picture,

00:08:03.040 --> 00:08:05.700
but it was more like, "I wanna focus on basketball."

00:08:07.040 --> 00:08:10.540
So, I can still hold out hope, you know?

00:08:14.910 --> 00:08:21.200
No, it's not the end at all. It's more like,
"Just wait till I'm done with basketball."

00:08:23.330 --> 00:08:27.870
The way she says that, without even hesitating,

00:08:29.200 --> 00:08:33.160
it's like she's practiced it on her own, over and over...

00:08:33.370 --> 00:08:36.580
getting it just right until she's convinced herself.

00:08:37.620 --> 00:08:40.450
C'mon, Akari. You can't just give up!

00:08:40.450 --> 00:08:45.200
Your senpai is making excuses now,
but if you keep at it, things will turn around, right?

00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:48.040
Well, maybe they won't...

00:08:48.040 --> 00:08:49.160
Yes, they will!

00:08:54.830 --> 00:08:55.950
Thanks, you guys.

00:08:56.910 --> 00:08:58.910
Fujishiro Bookstore

00:09:03.950 --> 00:09:07.830
Grandma! This goes over here, right?

00:09:13.410 --> 00:09:15.040
Welcome to our...

00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:18.370
What's the matter?

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:24.200
Ah! Just doing some shopping, that's all.

00:09:24.200 --> 00:09:27.120
But, your house is two stations away, right?

00:09:31.080 --> 00:09:35.910
I thought maybe I... I'd bring a souvenir from my trip.

00:09:35.910 --> 00:09:39.660
Well, you could have called me first.

00:09:40.040 --> 00:09:42.910
I might have been gone or something.

00:09:42.910 --> 00:09:46.620
If so, I would have given it to you at school.

00:09:46.620 --> 00:09:49.160
Well then, why not just do it there?

00:09:51.080 --> 00:09:52.330
Yeah...

00:09:56.870 --> 00:09:58.200
Um, well...

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:00.790
Senpai?

00:10:01.700 --> 00:10:03.000
Yes, what?!

00:10:04.750 --> 00:10:07.330
Just how much do you like me?

00:10:07.330 --> 00:10:09.160
What are you talking about?

00:10:11.120 --> 00:10:12.830
I like you a lot!

00:10:18.540 --> 00:10:22.910
She went to the planetarium, huh? Must be nice.

00:10:39.000 --> 00:10:40.370
Whoa...

00:10:41.950 --> 00:10:43.660
Am I happy to have gotten this?

00:10:44.580 --> 00:10:48.330
Yeah. I'm pretty happy... I guess.

00:10:50.290 --> 00:10:53.410
I mean, I do like the stars.

00:10:56.870 --> 00:10:59.080
Still, I'd think her sights would be set higher, so...

00:11:01.950 --> 00:11:07.700
Why would Nanami-senpai like ME?

00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:15.950
Still Up in the Air

00:11:16.040 --> 00:11:21.000
The One Who Likes Me

00:11:24.040 --> 00:11:26.040
Student Council Candidates 
Campaign Speech Assmbly
2nd Year                2nd Year                2nd Year
Toshihiko             Touko             Haruka
Saijo               Nanami             Murota

00:11:26.040 --> 00:11:28.160
Man, I'm kinda sweaty!

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:32.160
"...Making this school a much better place."

00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:49.450
Hey, you two. You nervous?

00:11:52.370 --> 00:11:53.410
Sayaka!

00:11:54.120 --> 00:11:57.410
Are you here to try to some scare tactics,
or out of genuine concern?

00:11:57.910 --> 00:12:01.370
In your case, the former.
In Koito-san's case, the latter.

00:12:01.580 --> 00:12:05.290
Just do your best, Koito-san. You can relax.

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:09.200
Even if you mess up,
Touko will make it all work somehow.

00:12:09.620 --> 00:12:11.120
Um! Okay...

00:12:11.120 --> 00:12:13.950
No matter what, we're bound to feel the pressure.

00:12:14.450 --> 00:12:15.870
That's just how things go, right?

00:12:16.290 --> 00:12:17.330
I swear...

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:22.450
Saeki-senpai, you truly believe
in Nanami-senpai, don't you?

00:12:22.790 --> 00:12:25.500
Because I've seen it for myself.

00:12:25.910 --> 00:12:30.330
Meaning, I've never once seen
Touko drop the ball when it counts.

00:12:34.500 --> 00:12:39.620
She's right. When the odds are against you,
it's easy to forget who you are...

00:12:40.120 --> 00:12:42.620
She really is amazing.

00:12:57.660 --> 00:12:58.580
Ma'am!

00:13:00.580 --> 00:13:03.040
Can I go outside and get some fresh air?

00:13:03.040 --> 00:13:05.580
Just make sure you're back
before things get started, okay?

00:13:05.580 --> 00:13:06.580
Yes, Ma'am!

00:13:07.040 --> 00:13:08.080
You okay?

00:13:11.000 --> 00:13:13.040
Would you mind joining me, please?

00:13:20.830 --> 00:13:23.620
You're looking pretty calm about all this.

00:13:24.540 --> 00:13:26.540
Not as much as you, though.

00:13:26.790 --> 00:13:30.790
As me? Well, I guess I'm used to all this.

00:13:33.620 --> 00:13:36.790
I see... That's good to know.

00:13:36.790 --> 00:13:41.540
Huh? Wait, so you brought me out here on purpose?

00:13:42.040 --> 00:13:46.330
I just thought, even if you were nervous,
it might be hard to admit.

00:13:47.370 --> 00:13:49.830
But I guess I went too far, didn't I?

00:13:51.540 --> 00:13:53.000
Shall we go back in?

00:14:03.830 --> 00:14:07.620
I really... tried my best to hide it.

00:14:08.330 --> 00:14:12.620
If it's enough to make your hands shake,
why not talk to Saeki-senpai or someone?

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:13.700
I couldn't do that!

00:14:19.700 --> 00:14:24.160
Sayaka and the others, they all believe in me.

00:14:27.120 --> 00:14:28.700
I don't want them to lose that faith.

00:14:31.790 --> 00:14:34.080
But why do you...?

00:14:38.870 --> 00:14:43.540
I don't think anyone even remembers me
back when I was young...

00:14:46.080 --> 00:14:49.750
My grades were average, and I didn't have many friends.

00:14:50.120 --> 00:14:54.290
I was shy, always hiding in somebody else's shadow...

00:14:58.620 --> 00:15:03.160
But one day, I just couldn't do that anymore.

00:15:03.830 --> 00:15:08.700
I studied as hard as I could, and thought about how I
could get other people to like me.

00:15:09.410 --> 00:15:13.870
Slowly, day by day, I was becoming the ideal "me."

00:15:15.000 --> 00:15:20.120
When you say you "couldn't do that anymore,"
did something happen?

00:15:26.160 --> 00:15:28.700
I used to be nothing, and I can't go back to that.

00:15:29.790 --> 00:15:34.450
I need... to stay who I am, someone special.

00:15:38.120 --> 00:15:42.500
Still, baring myself to you like this,
it's hard to call myself "special," huh?

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:44.290
How can you say that, after all this?!

00:15:48.200 --> 00:15:54.120
I'm not like the others.
I don't think you're perfect or anything like that.

00:15:54.700 --> 00:15:55.540
Huh?

00:15:56.290 --> 00:15:59.700
I'm the type who always tries
to take charge of things, you know?

00:15:59.700 --> 00:16:05.620
But then later, I'm not so sure of myself...
and that shows on your face, right?

00:16:05.910 --> 00:16:07.250
I get nervous and flushed...

00:16:08.700 --> 00:16:13.830
Which is why, showing me when
you feel "weak" doesn't change a thing.

00:16:14.330 --> 00:16:15.540
Please don't worry about it.

00:16:27.040 --> 00:16:28.080
Koito-san...

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:30.040
Turn around.

00:16:37.910 --> 00:16:39.120
Senpai...?

00:16:43.330 --> 00:16:46.870
Just for a little bit, okay? Please.

00:16:49.910 --> 00:16:51.750
You're being rather kind today...

00:16:52.120 --> 00:16:57.370
Who wouldn't be, seeing someone
looking as vulnerable as this?

00:16:58.040 --> 00:17:00.160
So, remember: This is normal.

00:17:01.620 --> 00:17:05.290
"Normal," huh? Of course you'd say that.

00:17:07.950 --> 00:17:11.410
Whatever I do, you don't hold it against me.

00:17:16.120 --> 00:17:17.200
Oh...

00:17:20.660 --> 00:17:22.410
...And so, what am I?

00:17:22.660 --> 00:17:26.040
You don't think anyone is special to you?

00:17:26.790 --> 00:17:30.790
Right. I'm sure no one-

00:17:32.750 --> 00:17:40.200
You don't have to try to be "special" in front of me.
I said something like that...

00:17:41.000 --> 00:17:44.500
Only Yuu. You're the only one who gets to see this.

00:17:46.160 --> 00:17:47.330
This is...

00:17:48.790 --> 00:17:50.830
a special side of her.

00:17:54.120 --> 00:17:59.500
And so, these are the changes I will put into place,
should I be your new student council president.

00:17:59.830 --> 00:18:03.910
With that, I conclude my campaign speech.

00:18:05.250 --> 00:18:07.700
Thank you all for your attention.

00:18:20.500 --> 00:18:25.290
Up next, with a stump speech on behalf
of candidate Touko Nanami,

00:18:25.620 --> 00:18:28.410
is Yuu Koito from Class 1-1.

00:18:28.410 --> 00:18:29.750
Please, when you're ready.

00:18:32.160 --> 00:18:33.120
I am!

00:18:34.790 --> 00:18:39.540
I don't know why Senpai has taken
such a special interest in me...

00:18:41.540 --> 00:18:42.660
And yet...

00:18:56.080 --> 00:19:01.370
I'm here in support of Touko Nanami.
From Class 1-1, I'm Yuu Koito.

00:19:01.790 --> 00:19:03.540
Give 'em hell, Yuu!

00:19:04.290 --> 00:19:07.700
There are some important reasons
why I think Nanami-senpai

00:19:07.700 --> 00:19:10.830
should be our next student council president.

00:19:11.450 --> 00:19:15.950
First, she sat on the student council her freshman year,

00:19:15.950 --> 00:19:21.250
and during that time, she not only performed her
duties but learned the inner workings of the council.

00:19:21.540 --> 00:19:22.790
Though she's really just a weakling!

00:19:23.700 --> 00:19:29.620
I'm a first-year, so all I know is what
I've heard from our upperclassmen,

00:19:30.200 --> 00:19:37.200
but the other council members all relied on her,
and even last year's president endorsed her,

00:19:37.200 --> 00:19:41.080
saying she was the only one
who could fill the position.

00:19:41.620 --> 00:19:44.000
Trying to put on some brave face, all on your own...

00:19:44.410 --> 00:19:46.950
How stubborn, how utterly stupid can you be?

00:19:47.620 --> 00:19:51.500
Not only does she keep the best interests
of the school and our classes in mind,

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:54.250
she greets everyone with a bright and cheerful smile

00:19:54.250 --> 00:20:00.250
while also keeping a level head when it comes
to making decisions, a mark of true leadership.

00:20:00.700 --> 00:20:05.870
And yet, if I'm the only one even
SHE can come to for help...

00:20:06.700 --> 00:20:11.080
I believe that Nanami-senpai would serve as
a role model for the entire student body,

00:20:11.080 --> 00:20:14.080
making this school a much better place.

00:20:14.620 --> 00:20:15.450
That's it.

00:20:16.450 --> 00:20:17.580
Which is why...

00:20:23.870 --> 00:20:28.870
That's why, I would like to serve on the student council!

00:20:31.910 --> 00:20:36.830
While I've worked for her during the election,
Senpai has done everything to perfection.

00:20:36.830 --> 00:20:42.540
Honestly, I thought she wouldn't need
the help of someone like me...

00:20:43.540 --> 00:20:47.950
Even so, she was kind enough
to say there are things that I can do.

00:20:49.160 --> 00:20:52.620
And that's why I'd like to help her!

00:20:55.250 --> 00:21:01.540
In closing, um, I hope you'll all cast
your vote to help her out.

00:21:02.040 --> 00:21:03.080
Well, that's all.

00:21:03.080 --> 00:21:04.290
Thank you very much!

00:21:07.250 --> 00:21:09.950
I said that so forcefully...

00:21:11.120 --> 00:21:14.160
Maybe we won't even have to do any campaigning.

00:21:14.700 --> 00:21:18.160
Up next, the candidate herself, Touko Nanami.

00:21:18.500 --> 00:21:19.330
Yes!

00:21:23.160 --> 00:21:25.160
Maybe that was a little too kind?

00:21:26.620 --> 00:21:27.830
It's just normal.

00:21:38.540 --> 00:21:42.950
I, Touko Nanami from Class 2-1, announce
my candidacy for student council president!

00:21:45.950 --> 00:21:48.620
Election Results
Class 2-1   Touko Nanami

00:21:48.950 --> 00:21:50.160
You did it!

00:21:50.160 --> 00:21:51.330
Great job!

00:21:51.330 --> 00:21:52.580
Thank you.

00:21:58.830 --> 00:21:59.790
Koito-san!

00:21:59.790 --> 00:22:00.790
We did it!

00:22:01.330 --> 00:22:04.370
You really came through for me. So, thank you.

00:22:04.370 --> 00:22:07.410
H-hey! What are you-?

00:22:07.830 --> 00:22:09.040
I so like you!

00:22:14.330 --> 00:22:15.450
Okay, got it.

00:22:16.660 --> 00:22:18.500
"Like," huh?

00:22:18.950 --> 00:22:21.250
That's still not something I'm capable of...

00:22:21.700 --> 00:22:25.160
Come on, Touko. Give the girl some space already.

00:22:25.370 --> 00:22:26.700
Fine.

00:22:31.040 --> 00:22:34.200
I'd made up my mind: I was going to stay close to her...

00:22:35.370 --> 00:22:40.250
But I hadn't yet realized that in order to do so,

00:22:41.790 --> 00:22:45.040
there was something I'd have to give up.

00:22:54.040 --> 00:22:57.040
Yuu, lemme borrow your charger... Whoa!

00:22:57.040 --> 00:22:58.160
What is this?!

00:22:58.160 --> 00:23:00.580
Don't just come barging into my room!

00:23:01.040 --> 00:23:02.410
Still, what is this?

00:23:02.410 --> 00:23:03.200
It's a gift.

00:23:03.200 --> 00:23:05.660
Oh... From your "girlfriend"?

00:23:06.540 --> 00:23:08.160
Are you just that stupid, Rei-chan?

00:23:08.160 --> 00:23:09.160
Hyaa!

00:23:10.830 --> 00:23:12.700
I did it! I reached the stars!

00:23:13.160 --> 00:23:14.870
Yeah, well, stop reaching.

00:23:16.620 --> 00:23:17.620
Thanks for this!

00:23:18.120 --> 00:23:19.830
Make sure you give it back!

00:23:25.500 --> 00:23:30.250
...but if you keep at it, things will turn around, right?

00:23:32.040 --> 00:23:34.830
Maybe one day...

00:23:36.830 --> 00:23:40.160
I can reach that star too.
